// Ch1 C1-09 "Oruvel by day", bark 1 of 6: the cookboat. A cook who feeds Rhen on credit and keeps
// the tally in knots. Written warm, never as foreshadowing (pillar 1). Field bark, no camera cues.
title: ch01_bark_cookboat
location: ch01/oruvel
---
Cook [smile]: That's nine knots, diver. I'm running out of rope. #line:ch01_bark_cook_001
Rhen [smile]: Tie a tenth. I'm good for it. #line:ch01_bark_cook_002
Cook [laugh]: Then you can untie three. Sit. Eat. #line:ch01_bark_cook_003
===
